<Group labelreference="L129" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">#To check for the order in h of the error, we first check how this finite difference approximation of the third derivative looks for the explicit form of the function u(x), and collect the terms for each power of h</Text-field>
