<Group labelreference="L132" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">#From this, we can see that, as h becomes small, the smallest power of h in the error will dominate, as the other ones will decrease faster. Hence, we can say that err=O(h^3), and we can confirm this by calculating the limit of the absolute value of the quotient of the error function and h^3:</Text-field>
</Input>
