<Group labelreference="L134" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">#This is a constant with respect to h, so we can say that the error decays to zero at least as fast as h^3. We conclude that the largest possible value of p is 3.</Text-field>
